@startuml SEQ_03_SCAN_QR_PUBLIK
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title SEQ-03 · Melihat Detail Aset via Scan QR\nAktor: Publik (no auth required) / Asisten (via generalisasi)

actor       "Publik /\nAsisten"            as User
boundary    "Browser"                      as Browser
control     "DetailInventarisController"   as Controller
entity      "DetailAset Model"             as ModelDA
entity      "Inventaris Model"             as ModelInv
database    "detail_aset"                  as DB

note over User, DB : Route publik – tidak memerlukan autentikasi\nGET /aset/{id}/detail (route name: aset.public-detail)

' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
== Scan QR Code → Lihat Detail Publik ==
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════

User    ->  Browser    : Scan QR code pada aset dengan kamera / QR reader
Browser ->  Controller : GET /aset/{id}/detail\n[NO AUTH – public route]

activate Controller
Controller -> ModelDA : findOrFail(id).load([\n  'inventaris.laboratorium',\n  'kategoriAset',\n  'riwayatKondisi' => latest 5\n])
activate ModelDA
ModelDA -> DB : SELECT detail_aset\n  JOIN inventaris JOIN laboratorium\n  JOIN kategori_aset\n  LEFT JOIN riwayat_kondisi\nWHERE detail_aset.id = ?
DB --> ModelDA : record
ModelDA --> Controller : DetailAset $aset
deactivate ModelDA

alt Aset tidak ditemukan
    Controller --> Browser : 404 Not Found
    Browser --> User : Halaman tidak ditemukan
else Aset ditemukan
    Controller -> Controller : increment('scan_count') jika ada field tersebut
    Controller --> Browser : Inertia::render('Aset/PublicDetail', [\n  aset,\n  laboratorium,\n  kategori,\n  kondisi_terakhir,\n  riwayat_kondisi\n])
    Browser --> User : Halaman publik detail aset:\n- Nama aset & kategori\n- Kondisi terkini\n- Nama laboratorium\n- Riwayat kondisi (5 terakhir)\n- TIDAK ada tombol CRUD
end
deactivate Controller

@enduml
